<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#05070f">
<title>Comparative Quest v3 — เกมฝึก -er / more (ป.5)</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html,body{overscroll-behavior:none}
body{font-family:'Segoe UI','Sarabun',Tahoma,sans-serif;background:#05070f;color:#eaf2ff;min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;
 padding:env(safe-area-inset-top) env(safe-area-inset-right) env(safe-area-inset-bottom) env(safe-area-inset-left);-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body.playing{overflow:hidden;position:fixed;width:100%}
#stars{position:fixed;inset:0;background:
 radial-gradient(2px 2px at 20% 30%,#fff,transparent),radial-gradient(2px 2px at 70% 60%,#9fd,transparent),
 radial-gradient(1px 1px at 40% 80%,#fff,transparent),radial-gradient(1px 1px at 85% 20%,#ffd,transparent);opacity:.35;pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
.screen{display:none;position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px}
.screen.on{display:block;animation:fade .35s ease}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.card{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#111c34,#0a1122);border:2px solid #2b4a7d;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
h1{font-size:clamp(21px,5.4vw,30px);text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffd93d,#ff8c42,#6bcB77,#4d96ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;margin-bottom:6px}
h2{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:10px;color:#ffd93d;text-align:center}
h3{font-size:16.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:#8fd3ff}
p.sub{text-align:center;color:#9fb3d4;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}
label{display:block;margin:10px 0 4px;font-size:14px;color:#a9c4e8}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px 13px;border-radius:10px;border:2px solid #2b4a7d;background:#0b1424;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-family:inherit}
input:focus,select:focus{outline:none;border-color:#ffd93d}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;border:none;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd93d,#ff9f1c);color:#20140a;transition:.15s;margin:4px 3px;min-height:44px}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.96)}
.btn.blue{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4d96ff,#2b6fd6);color:#fff}
.btn.green{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6bcB77,#2f9e57);color:#06210f}
.btn.red{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6b6b,#d63d3d);color:#fff}
.btn.purple{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b197fc,#7048e8);color:#fff}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:2px solid #4d96ff;color:#8fd3ff}
.btn.small{padding:8px 13px;font-size:13px;min-height:38px}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.4}
.center{text-align:center}
.modes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin:10px 0}
@media(max-width:460px){.modes{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.mode{padding:14px;border-radius:14px;border:2px solid #2b4a7d;background:#0e1a30;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;transition:.15s}
.mode.on{border-color:#ffd93d;background:#1d2438;box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(255,217,61,.25)}
.mode .em{font-size:30px;display:block}
.mode b{font-size:15px}.mode span{font-size:11.5px;color:#9fb3d4;display:block;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.5}
#hud{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#0b1424;border:2px solid #2b4a7d;
 border-radius:12px;padding:7px 10px;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
#hud>div{white-space:nowrap}
#hud .btn{padding:6px 9px;font-size:12px;min-height:34px;margin:0 1px}
#saveDot{opacity:.25;transition:.3s}
#saveDot.on{opacity:1;text-shadow:0 0 10px #6bcB77}
#gameWrap{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center}
canvas{border-radius:12px;border:3px solid #2b4a7d;background:#000;touch-action:none;display:block}
#levelBanner{position:absolute;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;
 background:rgba(0,0,0,.82);border-radius:12px;font-size:clamp(18px,4.6vw,26px);font-weight:800;text-align:center;padding:16px;z-index:5}
#pad{display:none;margin:8px auto 0;width:100%;max-width:232px;user-select:none}
#pad .r{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin:6px 0}
#pad button{width:66px;height:60px;font-size:26px;border-radius:16px;border:2px solid #4d96ff;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#1a3157,#0e1c33);color:#8fd3ff;font-weight:800;touch-action:none}
#pad button:active{background:#4d96ff;color:#04101f}
body.touch #pad{display:block}
@media(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:520px){
 #pad{position:fixed;left:8px;bottom:10px;width:176px;z-index:20;opacity:.93}
 #pad button{width:52px;height:46px;font-size:21px}}
.modal{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(3,6,14,.94);z-index:60;overflow-y:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;padding:10px}
.modal.on{display:block;animation:fade .25s}
.mbox{max-width:720px;margin:14px auto;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#132444,#0a1122);border:3px solid #ffd93d;border-radius:18px;padding:18px}
.mbox.boss{border-color:#ff6b6b;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#2a1024,#12060f)}
.flashno{animation:fno .45s}
@keyframes fno{0%,100%{box-shadow:none}40%{box-shadow:0 0 0 9999px rgba(255,60,60,.22) inset}}
#timerBar{height:12px;background:#22304d;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0 4px}
#timerFill{height:100%;width:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6bcB77,#ffd93d);transition:width .3s linear}
.qtag{display:inline-block;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;background:#4d96ff;color:#fff;margin-right:6px}
.qtag.lis{background:#a06bff}.qtag.spk{background:#ff6b9d}.qtag.rea{background:#4d96ff}.qtag.wri{background:#2f9e57}
.qtext{font-size:clamp(18px,4.6vw,22px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.7;margin:12px 0;text-align:center}
.qth{font-size:14px;color:#9fb3d4;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.6}
.choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}
@media(max-width:560px){.choices{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.choice{padding:15px;border-radius:13px;border:2px solid #2b4a7d;background:#0e1a30;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;color:#eaf2ff;min-height:52px}
.choice:active{transform:scale(.98)}
.choice.ok{background:#1d6b3a;border-color:#6bcB77}
.choice.no{background:#77202a;border-color:#ff6b6b}
.fb{margin-top:12px;padding:13px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;display:none}
.fb.ok{display:block;background:#12351f;border:2px solid #6bcB77}
.fb.no{display:block;background:#3a1620;border:2px solid #ff6b6b}
.wordbank{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin:12px 0}
.wchip{padding:11px 15px;border-radius:10px;background:#1b2a49;border:2px solid #4d96ff;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center}
.wchip.used{opacity:.28;pointer-events:none}
#orderLine{min-height:58px;border:2px dashed #4d96ff;border-radius:12px;padding:9px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;font-size:17px}
/* BOSS */
#bossBox{display:none;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px;padding:12px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#3a1020,#180810);border:2px solid #ff6b6b}
#bossEmo{font-size:56px;line-height:1;display:inline-block;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 12px #ff6b6b)}
#bossEmo.hit{animation:bhit .55s}
@keyframes bhit{0%{transform:scale(1)}18%{transform:scale(1.3) rotate(-10deg);filter:brightness(4)}55%{transform:scale(.86) rotate(8deg)}100%{transform:scale(1)}}
#bossEmo.atk{animation:batk .5s}
@keyframes batk{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}30%{transform:translateY(14px) scale(1.15)}60%{transform:translateY(-6px)}}
.hpwrap{height:18px;background:#2a0d16;border:2px solid #ff6b6b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin:8px auto 4px;max-width:420px}
.hpwrap i{display:block;height:100%;width:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff6b6b,#ffd93d);transition:width .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
#bossCombo{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#ffd93d;min-height:26px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:8px}
th,td{border:1px solid #2b4a7d;padding:6px 7px;text-align:center}
th{background:#1b2a49;color:#ffd93d;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1}
tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#0d1728}
.scroll{max-height:60vh;overflow:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;border-radius:12px}
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:14px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700}
.b-g{background:#2f9e57}.b-y{background:#c99a00;color:#1a1400}.b-r{background:#c0392b}
.lvl-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:11px;margin-top:12px}
.lvl{padding:15px;border-radius:14px;text-align:center;border:2px solid #2b4a7d;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;position:relative}
.lvl:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.lvl .em{font-size:32px;display:block}
.lvl.lock{opacity:.4}
.lvl .sv{position:absolute;top:6px;right:8px;font-size:15px}
.stat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(115px,1fr));gap:9px;margin:12px 0}
.st{background:#0e1a30;border:2px solid #2b4a7d;border-radius:12px;padding:11px;text-align:center}
.st b{display:block;font-size:23px;color:#ffd93d}
.st span{font-size:11.5px;color:#9fb3d4}
.bar{height:9px;background:#22304d;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4d96ff,#6bcB77)}
.note{font-size:12.5px;color:#8ea6c8;line-height:1.8}
.mic{width:100px;height:100px;border-radius:50%;font-size:42px;border:3px solid #ff6b9d;background:#2a1224;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;margin:8px}
.mic.rec{animation:pulse .9s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,107,157,.6)}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 18px rgba(255,107,157,0)}}
.podium{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;margin:16px 0}
.pod{border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:10px 6px;text-align:center;font-weight:800;min-width:31%}
.pod .nm{font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;word-break:break-word}
.pod .sc{font-size:19px;color:#fff}
.pod.p1{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffd93d,#c99a00);height:132px;color:#20140a}
.pod.p2{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#dfe6f0,#9aa7b8);height:105px;color:#12202f}
.pod.p3{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#e8a87c,#b06b3a);height:88px;color:#241005}
.pod .md{font-size:26px}
.lbrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#0e1a30;border:2px solid #2b4a7d;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;margin:7px 0;transition:.4s}
.lbrow.me{border-color:#ffd93d;background:#1d2438;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(255,217,61,.25)}
.lbrow .rk{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:40px;text-align:center;color:#ffd93d}
.lbrow .in{flex:1;min-width:0}
.lbrow .nm{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.lbrow .mt{font-size:11.5px;color:#8ea6c8}
.lbrow .sc{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#6bcB77;white-space:nowrap}
.chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:12px}
.chip{padding:8px 15px;border-radius:20px;background:#0e1a30;border:2px solid #2b4a7d;cursor:pointer;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;min-height:40px}
.chip.on{background:#ffd93d;color:#20140a;border-color:#ffd93d}
/* LIVE BOARD */
#scLive .lbrow{padding:14px 16px}
body.proj #scLive .lbrow .nm{font-size:clamp(18px,3vw,30px)}
body.proj #scLive .lbrow .sc{font-size:clamp(22px,3.6vw,40px)}
body.proj #scLive .lbrow .rk{font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,34px);width:64px}
body.proj #scLive .lbrow .mt{font-size:clamp(12px,1.5vw,17px)}
body.proj #scLive h1{font-size:clamp(26px,4.4vw,46px)}
.livedot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#6bcB77;margin-right:5px;animation:blink 1.2s infinite}
@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}
.livedot.off{background:#ff6b6b}
#printArea{display:none;color:#000;background:#fff;padding:18px;font-size:13px}
#printArea table{color:#000}#printArea th{background:#eee!important;color:#000!important}
#printArea td{background:#fff!important;border:1px solid #999}
@media print{body{background:#fff!important;color:#000!important}#stars,.screen,.modal,#pad{display:none!important}#printArea{display:block!important}}
#toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:22px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(90px);background:#132444;border:2px solid #6bcB77;
 padding:11px 20px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;z-index:90;transition:.3s;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;max-width:92vw;text-align:center}
#toast.on{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);opacity:1}
/* ===== มือถือ / แท็บเล็ต ===== */
html,body{touch-action:manipulation}
body{min-height:100vh;min-height:100dvh}
button,.btn,.choice,.wchip,.chip,.mode,.lvl,.mic,#hud,#pad,#gameWrap,#levelBanner{-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none}
input{-webkit-user-select:text;user-select:text}
canvas,#pad button{touch-action:none}
.modal{overscroll-behavior:contain}
body.touch .btn{min-height:46px}
body.touch #hud .btn{min-height:40px;padding:7px 11px}
@media(max-width:420px){.card{padding:14px}.mbox{padding:14px;margin:8px auto}.btn{padding:11px 14px}.qtext{font-size:19px}}
@media(max-height:620px){#bossEmo{font-size:38px}#bossBox{padding:7px;margin-bottom:6px}.hpwrap{height:13px;margin:5px auto 3px}#bossCombo{font-size:15px;min-height:20px}.mbox{margin:6px auto}}
@media(min-width:760px) and (hover:none) and (min-height:600px){#pad{max-width:300px}#pad button{width:84px;height:72px;font-size:30px}}
.nofs{display:none!important}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="stars"></div>
<div id="toast"></div>

<!-- ================= LOGIN ================= -->
<div class="screen on" id="scLogin">
  <div class="card" style="max-width:480px;margin:3vh auto">
    <h1>🟡 COMPARATIVE QUEST</h1>
    <p class="sub">เกมผจญภัยฝึกการเปรียบเทียบขั้นกว่า <b>-er / more</b><br>ภาษาอังกฤษ ชั้นประถมศึกษาปีที่ 5 · เวอร์ชัน 3.2</p>

    <h3 style="text-align:center">เลือกโหมดการเล่น</h3>
    <div class="modes">
      <div class="mode on" id="mdSolo" onclick="selectMode('solo')">
        <span class="em">🏠</span><b>ฝึกฝนส่วนตัว</b>
        <span>เล่นที่บ้าน · บันทึกความคืบหน้าในเครื่อง</span></div>
      <div class="mode" id="mdLive" onclick="selectMode('live')">
        <span class="em">🔥</span><b>แข่งสดทั้งห้อง</b>
        <span>เล่นที่โรงเรียน · คะแนนขึ้นจอโปรเจกเตอร์</span></div>
    </div>

    <div id="roomBox" style="display:none">
      <label>🔑 รหัสห้องแข่ง (ครูเป็นผู้กำหนด)</label>
      <input id="inRoom" placeholder="เช่น P5-1" autocomplete="off" oninput="this.value=this.value.toUpperCase()">
      <p class="note center" id="netHint"></p>
    </div>

    <label>👤 ชื่อ–นามสกุล</label>
    <input id="inName" placeholder="เช่น สมชาย ใจดี" autocomplete="off">
    <label>🏫 ชั้น/ห้อง (พิมพ์เอง)</label>
    <input id="inClass" placeholder="เช่น ป.5/1" autocomplete="off">
    <label>🔢 เลขที่</label>
    <input id="inNo" type="number" min="1" max="99" placeholder="เช่น 12">

    <div class="center" style="margin-top:16px">
      <button class="btn" onclick="doLogin()">🎮 เริ่มเล่นเกม</button>
    </div>
    <div class="center" style="margin-top:6px">
      <button class="btn purple small" onclick="openLB()">🏆 กระดานผู้นำ</button>
      <button class="btn ghost small" onclick="openTeacher()">🔐 สำหรับคุณครู</button>
      <button class="btn ghost small" onclick="openSettings()">⚙️ ตั้งค่าเซิร์ฟเวอร์</button>
    </div>
    <p class="note center" style="margin-top:12px">💡 คอมพิวเตอร์ใช้ลูกศร/WASD · มือถือ–ไอแพดใช้ปุ่มบนจอหรือปัดนิ้ว<br>🎤 ข้อพูดต้องอนุญาตไมโครโฟน ใช้ Chrome / Edge / Safari พร้อมอินเทอร์เน็ต<br>📱 iPhone/iPad: เปิดผ่าน Safari ตามปกติ (ไม่ต้องเพิ่มลงหน้าจอโฮม) และปิดโหมดเงียบเพื่อให้ได้ยินเสียง</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ================= MENU ================= -->
<div class="screen" id="scMenu">
  <div class="card">
    <h1>เลือกด่านผจญภัย</h1>
    <p class="sub" id="menuHello"></p>
    <div id="liveBadge"></div>
    <div id="resumeBox"></div>
    <div class="lvl-grid" id="lvlGrid"></div>
    <div class="center" style="margin-top:14px">
      <button class="btn purple" onclick="openLB()">🏆 กระดานผู้นำ</button>
      <button class="btn blue" onclick="liveReport()">📊 รายงานผลของฉัน</button>
      <button class="btn ghost small" id="btnLiveMini" onclick="openLiveBoard()" style="display:none">📺 ดูอันดับสด</button>
    </div>
    <h3>📘 กติกาการเล่น</h3>
    <p class="note">
      • เก็บ <b>ไอเท็มคำถาม 6 ชิ้น</b> ที่กระจายอยู่ทั่วกระดานให้ครบเพื่อผ่านด่าน<br>
      • ไอเท็มแต่ละชิ้นมีทักษะต่างกัน 🎧 ฟัง · 🎤 พูด · 📖 อ่าน · ✍️ เขียน (ครบทั้ง 4 ทักษะทุกด่าน)<br>
      • ข้อ 🎤 พูด: <b>AI จะฟังเสียงอ่านของนักเรียนและตรวจให้</b> พูดซ้ำได้ 3 ครั้งต่อข้อ<br>
      • ระวังผี 👻 ชนแล้วเสีย 1 ชีวิต (มี 3 ชีวิต) · กินเม็ดพลัง ⭐ แล้วไล่กินผีได้ 7 วินาที<br>
      • เก็บครบ 6 ชิ้นแล้วเจอ <b>🐲 บอสมังกรไวยากรณ์</b> — ตอบถูกติดกันได้ COMBO คะแนนทวีคูณ<br>
      • 💾 เกมบันทึกความคืบหน้าอัตโนมัติ ปิดแล้วกลับมาเล่นต่อจุดเดิมได้
    </p>
    <div class="center" style="margin-top:10px">
      <button class="btn ghost small" onclick="toggleMusic()" id="btnMus">🎵 เพลง: เปิด</button>
      <button class="btn ghost small" onclick="toggleSfx()" id="btnSfx">🔊 เสียง: เปิด</button>
      <button class="btn ghost small" onclick="logout()">🚪 ออกจากระบบ</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ================= GAME ================= -->
<div class="screen" id="scGame">
  <div id="hud">
    <div id="hLvl">ด่าน 1</div>
